# Profile & Role Management Enhancements Plan

## Goal Description
Enhance the Profile section of the Gurudevi mobile app to improve user experience and functionality. Key goals include adding logout capability, improving the profile card UI (larger edit touch area, full-screen mode), integrating QR codes for ID and invitations, and adding role management features for testing and administration.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Role Management Security**: The requested "Role Dropdown" for testing allows effortless role switching. This strictly for DEVELOPMENT/TESTING environments or specific admin users. I will implement this behind a dev-flag or specific admin check to prevent unauthorized role escalation in production.

> [!NOTE]
> **QR Code Integration**: We will use a standard QR code library (`react-native-qrcode-svg`) to generate codes.

## Proposed Changes

### Profile Section
#### [MODIFY] [ProfileScreen.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/ProfileScreen.tsx)
- Add "Logout" button/action.
- Add "Role Switching" (Dev only).
- Implement `fullScreen` toggle for [IdentityCard](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/profile/IdentityCard.tsx#33-176).
- Add new sections:
    - **User Stats/Growth**: "Impact Card" showing role-based stats (e.g., Classes, Students, or Assignments).
    - **Expanded Details**: School, Class/Grade info, Contact details (editable).
    - **Help & Support**: New navigation item/section.

#### [MODIFY] [IdentityCard.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/profile/IdentityCard.tsx)
- Increase touch area for "Edit".
- Add animation for "Full Screen" expansion.
- In Full Screen:
