    - Show expanded details (Bio, Contact).
    - "Edit Photo" button.

#### [NEW] [UserStatsCard.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/profile/UserStatsCard.tsx)
- **Role-Based Stats**:
    - **Teacher**: Classes Taught, Attendance Taken (Mock/Real), "Guru Points" (Growth).
    - **Student**: Assignments Turned In, Attendance Streak.
    - **Principal**: School Overview (Mini).
- **Gamification**: Visual progress bar or "Level" indicator (Mock for now).

#### [NEW] [SupportSection.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/profile/SupportSection.tsx)
- Links to: "Contact Support", "FAQ", "Report Issue".

### Role Management
#### [MODIFY] [useUserRole.ts](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/hooks/useUserRole.ts)
- Support "Founder/Development Admin" role.
- Add helper to switch roles (persisted in local state for session).

### QR Code Integration
#### [NEW] [QRCodeGenerator.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/shared/QRCodeGenerator.tsx)
- Reusable component.
- Input: String (Invite Code or User ID).

#### [MODIFY] [InviteManager.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/principal/InviteManager.tsx)
- Add "Show QR" button next to generated invite codes.
- Opens a modal with the `QRCodeGenerator` encoding the `GURU-...` code.

#### [MODIFY] [AuthScreen.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/AuthScreen.tsx)
- Add "Scan Quick-Login / Join" button.
- Logic:
    - Scans QR.
    - If format `GURU-...`: Pre-fills "Join School" flow (skips manual entry).
    - If format `UUID`: (Future) "Login with Passkey/Device" or "View Profile".

#### [MODIFY] [IdentityCard.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/profile/IdentityCard.tsx)
- Back of card shows QR of *User ID* (for networking/sharing profile).
- **Distinction**:
    - **Invite QR**: "Join my School" (Principal/Admin generates).
    - **Identity QR**: "This is Me" (Everyone has).

### Additional (MoSCoW)
- **Could Have**: "Saved Resources" section in Profile (Placeholder).
- **Could Have**: "App Settings" (Theme/Language - existing, improve UI).

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1.  **Logout**: Verify auth state clear and nav to Auth screen.
2.  **Full Screen**:
    - Tap card -> Expands to cover screen.
    - Animation is smooth.
    - All details (School, Email, Phone) visible.
    - Edit Photo works (opens picker).
3.  **Role Switch**:
    - Switch to "Student" -> Verify Stats change to "Assignments".
    - Switch to "Teacher" -> Verify Stats change to "Classes".
    - Switch to "Founder" -> See all debug options.
4.  **QR Code**: Scannable (use phone camera to test string content).
5.  **Support**: Buttons clickable.
